<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21021" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόμος</span></b>  (A), ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέμω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>any loud noise</i>, as the <i>crackling</i> of fire,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.396
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				165
			</span></i>; <i>roaring</i> of thunder, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.27
			</span></i>; of a storm, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				213
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				195
			</span></i> codd.; of the drum, [<i><span class="en">
				Simon.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				179.7
			</span></i>; of horses, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				476
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάφω β.</span>
			<i>belling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				97
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Poxy.</u>
				1789.29
			</span></i>); of the flute, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				452
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				513
			</span></i>: hence, <i>rage, fury</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1212
			</span></i>:— rare in Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόμοι καὶ ὀλολυγμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					143
				</span></i>
			; of thunder, earthquake, or sea, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395a13
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				396a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mir.</u>
				843a8
			</span></i>; of a volcano, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				634
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος εἰς ὃν ἔλαφοι οὐροῦσι καὶ
				ἀφοδεύουσι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
